  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader for Codabar from Word is a VB.NET barcode scanner library to read, scan Codabar barcode from Word in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example VB.NET source code to scan, read, decode Codabar data message from Word file in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/vbnet_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
